            <fr:title text="Flag witnesses for the partner variety">Flag witnesses for the partner variety</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>proposition</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="area">foundations</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="status">proven</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="provenance">journal sec:notflag (the <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 3]]></fr:tex> non-flag component is a cone over a twisted cubic); distilled.tex Part 1.</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Let <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathfrak {n}]]></fr:tex> be the strictly upper triangular matrices. Then <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[
  \mathcal {FL} \coloneqq  \bigcup _{g \in  \mathrm {GL}_n(\mathbb {F}_q)} g \mathfrak {n} g^{-1}
  \subseteq  V(J),
]]></fr:tex>
a finite union of linear subspaces of dimension <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\frac {n(n - 1)}{2}]]></fr:tex>, indexed
by the <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathbb {F}_q]]></fr:tex>-rational complete flags.</html:p>
            <html:p>More generally any nilpotent <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[M]]></fr:tex> with <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[[M, F(M)] = 0]]></fr:tex> lies in
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[V(J)]]></fr:tex>, as does any <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[M]]></fr:tex> such that <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[M]]></fr:tex> and <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[F(M)]]></fr:tex> are
strictly triangular with respect to a common flag. For <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 2]]></fr:tex> these
mechanisms exhaust <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[V(J)]]></fr:tex>; already for <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 3]]></fr:tex> they do not,
so the flag locus is not all of the partner variety — only,
conjecturally, all of it up to dimension.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:em>Uses:</html:em> <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0006/" title="The pencil criterion" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0006/" display-uri="ffi-0006" type="local">The pencil criterion</fr:link>.</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
        <fr:tree show-metadata="true" expanded="false" toc="false" numbered="false">
          <fr:frontmatter>
            <fr:authors />
            <fr:uri>https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0055/</fr:uri>
            <fr:display-uri>ffi-0055</fr:display-uri>
